# Windows 与 Mac 通过 Syncthing 共用同一份工作区和 .git：文本一律 LF，
# 否则 Windows（core.autocrlf=true）检出的 CRLF 同步到 Mac 后会整批显示为已修改
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
